<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">LUSI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Lusi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lusi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lus</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu chi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Che Lusi</para>
  <para style="mt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chi che Lusi chikusala indu yakusimonjeka iyaasime ŵapannango umo wa Ŵaisilaeli pa chipindi cha Ŵakulamula ŵa ku Isilaeli. Che Naomi juŵaliji achikulu jwa ŵapannango wu, akusimanikwa ni kuwililwa kwakukulungwa, katema ŵankwakwe ni achiŵanagwe ŵaŵili ŵachilume paŵawile ali kuchilendo ku chilambo cha ku Moabu. Pakumala yeleyo, che Naomi akupochela upile pakumala che Lusi juŵaliji jumo mwa achakwegwawo, juŵaliji jwa ku chilambo cha ku Moabu, paŵawamwiwe nsyene kwakuya akwegwawo ni kwakamuchisya. Che Naomi akulongana ni che Lusi pa ulendo wa kuuja ku chilambo chakwe cha ku Isilaeli. Pakumala pelepo che Lusi ni che Naomi, ŵanawose akulisimana achipochelaga upile apala che Boasi, jumo mwa ŵapaulongo wakuŵandika wa ŵapannango wa che Naomi paŵawamwiwe kwagosa ni kukunda kulombela che Lusi. Katema ka Ŵakulamula kaliji katema changalumbana ligongo Ŵaisilaeli ŵali ŵajinji ŵatemi pangali kugakamulisya malajisyo, nambo che Naomi, ni che Lusi ni che Boasi ŵaliji chisyasyo chambone kwa Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵatamaga ali nkugakamulisya ni kugakuya malajisyo ga Akunnungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngapagwa jwalijose jwakwimanyilila mundu juŵalembile chitabu chi che Lusi. Lyuŵa liŵalembile chitabu chi nombe ngalikumnyika nambo achajinji akuganichisya kuti chitabu chi chalembekwe pakumala Ŵaisilaeli kutyoka ku usami malinga ni Chiebulania chachitumiche pa kulemba chitabu chi. Chindu chachili cha maana kwannope ni kuti mwenye che Daudi ŵaliji chisukulu chi che Lusi, jwankongwe juŵaliji ngaŵa Mwisilaeli. Chelechi malumbo gakwe kuti jwankongwe ju nombe akwete lipesa pa achachekulu wa mu lukosyo lwa che Yesu. Chelechi chindu chi chikusala usyene kuti, Akunnungu ngakusagula malinga ni ŵapaulongo, nambo akusagula malinga ni ntima wa mundu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani sya ŵapannango wa che Naomi ni kuwililwa kwakukulungwa kukwasimene, che Naomi ni che Lusi iŵatite kuuja ku Isilaeli, mukusalikwa mu sula ja 1.</para>
  <para style="io">Che Lusi iŵatite kusimana ni che Boasi paŵaliji nkwimilila masengo ga kugungula ku ngunda wakwe. Che Lusi ŵaliji nkulokota maŵasaŵasa ga magungulo mu ngunda pakumala ŵakugungula kusonganganya magungulo, mukusalikwa mu sula ja 2.</para>
  <para style="io">Che Naomi iŵatite kunnajisya che Lusi ansache che Boasi kuti ŵalombele ni kwagosa ligongo ŵaliji jwa paulongo wakuŵandichila malinga ni kulombekana. Che Boasi ŵakundile kuchitenda chele chindu cho, mukusalikwa mu sula ja 3</para>
  <para style="io">Che Boasi iŵatite kuuwombola ngunda uwaliji wa malehemu ŵankwakwe che Naomi, ni sooni kulombela che Lusi, mukusalikwa mu sula ja 4.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Che Elimeleki ni ŵa munyuumba jao akusaamila ku Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Kalakala ko katema ŵakulamula paŵaliji nkulongosya ku Isilaeli, jakopochele sala pachilambo cho. Mundu jumo kutyochela ku Beselehemu ja ku Yuda pamo ni ŵankwakwe ni achiŵanagwe ŵaŵili ŵachilume ŵajawile kukutama kwakatema ku chilambo cha ku Moabu nti achalendo. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Jwele mundu ju jwaŵilanjikwe che Elimeleki ni ŵankwawo ŵaŵilanjikwe che Naomi. Achiŵanagwe ŵaŵili ŵala, jumo ŵaŵilanjikwe che Mahaloni ni jwine ŵaŵilanjikwe che Kilioni. Mundu ju ni achalongo achinjakwe ŵaliji ŵa lukosyo lwa Efulati ku Beselehemu ja ku Yuda kula. Ni ŵaikangene ku Moabu ni kutama kweleko. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Che Elimeleki ŵankwakwe che Naomi ŵajasiche ni che Naomi ŵasigalile ni achiŵanagwe ŵaŵili. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Achachanda wo ŵalombele achiŵali ŵa Chimoabu, mwali jumo jwaŵilanjikwe che Opa ni mwali jwine jwaŵilanjikwe che Lusi. Paŵatemi kweleko yaka likumi, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />wose ŵanaŵaŵili, che Maloni ni che Kilioni nombe nawo ŵajasiche ni che Naomi jwaliji jwakuwililwa ni ŵankwakwe ni achiŵanagwe.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Naomi ni che Lusi akuujanga ku Beselehemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Pelepo che Naomi ŵapilikene kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapele upile ŵandu ŵakwe ni kwapa chakulya, nipele ŵaliŵisile chile kutyoka ku Moabu ni kuuja kumangwakwe pamo ni achakwegwao. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Nipele ŵatyosile paŵatamaga pala ni achakwegwao, ŵakamwile litala lya kuuja ku Yuda. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Pelepo che Naomi ŵaasalile achakwegwao ŵala, “Mmujangane jwalijose kumusi kwa achikulugwe. Ambuje Akunnungu ampanganyichisye yambone mpela intite pakuumbanganyichisya une ni ŵandu ŵangu ŵaajasiche ŵala. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Ambuje Akunnungu ankamuchisye jwalijose mwa ŵanyamwe akole jwannume ni nyuumba jakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Nipele che Naomi ŵaalanjile kwakwanonyela, nambo ŵanyawo ŵatandite kulila kwaliloŵe, <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />ni kwasalila, “Ngaŵa yeleyo, tutujaule pamo ni mmwe kwa ŵandu ŵenu.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Nombe che Naomi ŵatite, “Mmujangane achiŵanangu. Kwaligongo chi nnongane ni une? Ana nkuganisya kuti ngukombola kukola sooni ŵanache uchaŵe achiŵankwenu? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Mmujangane mmangwenu achiŵanangu pakuŵa uneji njekulwipe nnope, ngangukombola kulombekwa sooni. Namose ngatite ngwete chilolelo, ni namose ngawonegene ni jwannume chilo chino ni kukola ŵanache ŵachilume, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />ana nkakombwele kulindilila mpaka apatanje masusa? Ana nkakombwele kulisiŵila nkalombekwa ni achalume ŵane? Ngaŵa achiŵanangu! Pakuŵa uneji ngwete ipwetesi kwannope kumpunda ŵanyamwe ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu ambutile.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Pelepo ŵatandite sooni kulila kwa liloŵe, ni che Opa ŵankumbete nkwegwao, ŵannanjile ni kuuja kumangwakwe, nambo che Lusi ŵakanile kulekangana nawo. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Nipele che Naomi ŵansalile, “Che Lusi, nnole alumbu ŵenu ausile kumangwakwe ni kwa nnungu jwakwe, nipele nomwe nombe mbuje mwakuye alumbu ŵenu.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Nambo che Lusi ŵajanjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">“Ngasimunjondelela nanneche mmwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">namose ngasimunganya kulongana ni mmwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">Papali pose pachinjaule, kweleko ni une ni kuchinyaule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">ni pachintame, ni une chindame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">ŵandu ŵenu chaŵe ŵandu ŵangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">ni Akunnungu ŵenu chaŵe Akunnungu ŵangu.<verse eid="RUT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Pele pachinjasichile, papopo ni une chinyasichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">ni papopo chisichikwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">Ambuje Akunnungu ambe majamuko gachikali iŵaga chinekanywe nomwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">ikaŵe kwa chiwa pe.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Che Naomi paŵaiweni kuti che Lusi awamwiwe kwaula pamo nawo, ŵalesile kwanyenga.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Nipele wose ŵanaŵaŵili ŵajendelechele ni ulendo mpaka ku Beselehemu. Paŵaiche kweleko, ŵandu wose ŵasimosile namose achakongwe ŵausyene, “Ana ŵelewo che Naomi?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Che Naomi ŵatite “Nnaamilanje sooni che Naomi, muumilanje che Mala pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaali ni machili gose asitesile ndamo syangu siŵe syaipwetesi kwannope. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Panatyosile pelepa nakwete indu yejinji, nambo sambano Ambuje Akunnungu amusisye makonope. Kwachichi kumilanga che Naomi iŵaga Ambuje Akunnungu anyamwiche, ni Ambuje Akunnungu anagesye?”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Yeleyi ni iŵatite pa kuuja che Naomi kutyochela ku Moabu pamo ni che Lusi akwegwao jwa ku Moabu, ni kwinjila ku Beselehemu katema magungulo ga shayili pagaliji nkutanda.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Che Lusi akupanganya masengo ku ngunda wa che Boasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Che Naomi ŵaliji ni nlongo njakwe juŵaŵilanjikwe che Boasi jwa ntundu wa che Elimeleki ŵankwakwe. Mundu ju ŵaliji jwachipanje ni ŵachimbichikwe kwannope ligongo lya ipanganyoyakwe yambone. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Lyuŵa limo che Lusi Mmoabu ŵansalile che Naomi, “Mungunde nyaule kumigunda ngatende mawasawasa papalipose pachingundikwe ni nsyene ngunda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Che Naomi ŵanjanjile, “Hayaga, njauleje mwanangu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Nipele che Lusi ŵajawile kumigunda, ŵaakuiye ŵakugungula achilokotanyaga masache gaŵalesile. Ni yakopochele kuti nngunda uwalokotaga waliji wa che Boasi, jwa ntundu wa che Elimeleki ŵankwakwe che Naomi.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Papopo, che Boasi ŵaiche kutyochela ku Beselehemu ni kwakomasya ŵakugungula achitiji, “Ambuje Akunnungu aŵe ni ŵanyamwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Ni ŵanyawo ŵajitichisye, “Ambuje Akunnungu ampe upile.”<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Nipele che Boasi ŵambusisye jwakwajimilila ŵakugungula, “Ana jwankongwe jula ni ncheni?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Jwakwajimilila ŵakugungula jula ŵajanjile, “Jwankongwe jula ali Mmoabu jwausile pamo ni che Naomi kutyochela ku chilambo cha ku Moabu. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Ŵamendile nakunde ŵakuye kunyuma ŵakugungula achilokotanyaga mawasawasa mungunda. Nipele ŵaiche ni apanganyisye masengo kutandila kundaŵi, ni sambano pejino ajawile kukupumulila pa lisakasa.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Nipele che Boasi ŵansalile che Lusi “Mpilikanile mwanangu, nkajaula kukulokota mawasawasa pangunda wine, namose nkatyoka pelepa, nlongane ni achiŵali ŵangu ŵaakupanganya masengo. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Nnole peuto paakugungulu mmeje papopo, naajamwiche achachanda ŵa akasansausya. Ni mwapilikanaga njota, njaule ku lulo ni ng'weje meesi gaatechile achachanda wo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Pelepo che Lusi ŵaatindiŵalile che Boasi ni kwajinamila kwakwachimbichisya, ni kwausya, “Mbatile chinauli kukundikwa paujo penu kwampaka kuungolela chanasa kwanti yeleyo ni uneji ndili jwannendope?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Nambo che Boasi ŵajanjile, “Mbilikene yanayose imwapanganyichisye akwegwenu chitandile paŵajasiche ŵankwenu ni intite kwaleka achaŵelesi ŵenu, ni kuchileka chilambo chenu chimpagwilwe ni kwika kukutama pasikati ja ŵandu ŵanganimwamanyilila chitandile kuundanda. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Ambuje Akunnungu ampe mbote kwa yanayose impanganyisye. Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli umwautuchile angose, ampe ntulilo wemalilwe.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Che Lusi ŵajanjile, “Achimwene, alakwe mundendele yambone kwannope, namuno uneji nganiŵa jumo jwa achikatumetume ŵenu, pakuŵa mmwejo mundusisye ntima, ni kukunguluka ni uneji kwa kutulala.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Katema ka chakulya che Boasi ŵammilanjile che Lusi chakulya, ŵansalile, “Kalibu apano, njise kunlye nkate ni kutoŵela mu divai.” Kwapele che Lusi ŵatemi pamo ni ŵakugungula ni che Boasi ŵampele imanga yekalanje, che Lusi ŵalile ni kwikuta mpaka ŵasigesye. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Ni yaliji Che Lusi paŵajendelechele kulokotanya mawasawasa, che Boasi ŵaasalile ŵamasengo ŵakwe “Munneche asonganganye namose pajili ilingo, nkannekasya. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Sooni mwasolomolele masache mu ilingo ni kunnechela alokotanye pangali kunnekasya.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Nipele che Lusi ŵalokwete mawasawasa mungunda mpaka ligulo. Ni paŵaputukwile shayili jila ŵagumbesye lidebe limo ni konjechesa. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Ni ŵatwichile ni kwaula mmusi. Ŵannosisye akwegwao yalokwete yo, ŵatyosisye yakulya yasigesye paŵajikwite ni kwapa. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Nipele akwegwao ŵambusisye, “Ana nnokwete kwapi lelo? Mwaliji ngunda wa acheni? Akole upile ŵelewo ŵammanyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Pelepo che Lusi ŵansalile che Naomi kuti ŵapanganyisye mungunda wa mundu jwakuŵilanjikwa che Boasi.<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Nipele che Naomi ŵansalile akwegwao, “Ambuje Akunnungu ŵape upile che Boasi! Akunnungu akugumbalichisya ilanga yakwe kwa ŵaali ŵajumi ni ŵajasiche.” Ni ŵajendelechele kuŵecheta, “Mundu ju ali nnongo njetu ni sooni ali jumo jwa aŵala ŵakusachilwa kutuwombola.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Nipele che Lusi ŵatite, “Elo, aasalile ngamulangane ni ŵamasengo ŵakwe mpaka amalisye magungulo gose.”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Nipele che Naomi ŵansalile che Lusi nkwegwakwe, “Mwanangu ili yambone mmwe kulongana nawo ŵamasengo ŵakwe, kuti mme salama.” <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Kwapele che Lutu ŵalongene ni ŵamasengo ŵakwe che Boasi ni kulokotanya masache mpaka kumbesi kwa magungulo ga shayili ni ngano. Katema kose ŵaliji nkutama ni che Lusi akwegwao.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Che Naomi akwashauli che Lusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Pakumala yeleyo che Naomi ŵaasalile che Lusi akwegwao, “Ana mwanangu ngiŵa yambone nansosele ŵalume kuti nkole nyumba jenu mwasyene. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Sambano aju che Boasi jumwapanganyisye masengo pamo ni ŵamasengo ŵakwe ali jwa ntundu wetu. Mpilikane, chilo cha lelo taaŵe nkupeta shayili peuto pakuputila. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Kwapele, njoje, npakale mauta gakununjila ni kuwalila chambone, nipele njaule peuto pakuputila, nambo nlolechesye nkalilosya kukwakwe mpaka patamale kulya ni kung'wa. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Nombe chiiŵe katema patagone, mpamanyilile patagone ni amalaga kugona lugono mwajaulile mbolembole, mbunukule makongolo gakwe ni kugona papopo. Nombewo tansalile chakutenda.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Che Lusi ŵajanjile “Yose imuusalile chimbanganye.”<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Nipele che Lusi ŵajawile mpaka peuto pakuputila, ŵatesile mpela iŵatite pakusalilwa ni akwegwao. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Che Boasi paŵamalisisye kulya ni kug'wa ŵasengwile muntima, nipele ŵajawile pachiŵandi ni chilingo cha shayili ni kugona. Che Lusi ŵajawile mbolembole ŵagaunukwile makongolo ga ga che Boasi ni kugona papopo. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Pasikati chilo che Boasi ŵatojime, ni ŵagalawiche, nipele wasimonjile kummona jwankongwe ali agonile ku makongolo gakwe. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Ŵatite “Ana mmweji ŵani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Che Lusi ŵajanjile, “Ndili une che Lusi katumetume jwenu. Pakuŵa mmwejo ni nlongo jwangu jwakuŵandichila, mmwejo ni junkusachilwa kumombola une, kwapele njinjile majumba.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Che Boasi ŵatite, “Ambuje Akunnungu ampe upile mwanangu, pakuŵa nkulosya unonyelo wakukulupichika kwannope kupunda aula umwalosisye kuundanda, pakuŵa nganimwakuya achachanda ŵakulaga pane ŵali ni chipanje kuti annombele. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Sambano mwanangu ngasinkola lipamba, uneji chinantendele yanayose inkuŵecheta pakuŵa kila mundu mmusi muno akummanyilila kuti nli ŵakongwe ŵambone. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Sooni isyene kuti uneji nlongo jundi jwakuŵandichila ni jungusachilwa kummombola mmwe, nambo apali mundu jwali nlongo jwakuŵandichila nnope kumbunda une. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Kwapele ntame apano chilo chose ni kundaŵi tutulole iŵaga chakunde kummombola pane ngwamba. Iŵaga tammombole ili yambone nambo ŵelewo akanaga, kwa liina lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi uneji tinammombole. Ngoneje apano mpaka kundaŵi.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Nipele che Lusi ŵagonile ku makongolo ga che Boasi mpaka kundaŵi, nambo ŵatyosile kundaŵindaŵipe mundu akanakombole kummanyilila njakwe, pakuŵa che Boasi ŵatite ŵandu akaimanyilila kuti jwankongwe ŵaiche peuto pakuputila yakulya pa. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Sooni che Boasi ŵansalile, “Ntandiche nguo jenu paasi” Che Lusi ŵatesile yeleyo, ni che Boasi ŵampimile mbiisi nsano ni jimo sya shayiri ni kwatwika ni che Lusi ŵausile kumangwakwe. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Paŵaiche kwa akwegwao, akwegwao ŵambusisye, “Uli mwanangu iŵele uli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:16">Che Lusi ŵansalile yanayose yapanganyichisye ni che Boasi. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Nipele ŵatite “Nkauja kwa akwegwenu makono pe,” kwayele ŵambele mbiisi nsano ni jimo si sya shayili.<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Nombe che Naomi ŵatite, “Sano, mwanangu che Lusi ntulale mpaka pachimmanyilile ichikopochele, pakuŵa che Boasi ngalechela papopo, nambo taikolosye yele indu yo lelo.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Che Boasi akwalomba che Lusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Katema ko che Boasi ŵakwesile kwaula pamalo pakutendela nkungulu kwele kwauli nlango wa musi ni kutama paasi. Nipele nlongo njakwe che Elimeleki juŵasachilwe aŵe jwandanda kuwombola, juŵangambaga che Boasi jula ŵapite chiŵandika ni pelepo. Che Boasi ŵambilasile, ŵatite, “Njise kuntame apano nlongo njangu.” Nombejo ŵaiche ni kutama pelepo. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Pelepo che Boasi ŵaŵilasile achachekulu likumi pasikati ja achachekulu ŵaŵatamaga musi mula, ŵaŵendile atamanje pelepo. Ni ŵatemi. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Che Boasi ŵansalile nlongo njakwe jula, “Che Naomi jwausile apano kutyochela ku chilambo cha ku Moabu akusumisya ngunda uwaliji wa nlongo njetu che Elimeleki. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Nipele uneji naiweni yambone kummanyisya mmwe ni kunsalila nsume paujo pa ŵandu ŵaali apano ni paujo pa achachekulu ŵa ŵandu ŵangu. Iŵaga mmwejo chimmombole ayaga mmomboleje nambo iŵaga ngammombola muusalile kuti ni uneji manyilile. Pakuŵa ngapagwa mundu jwine jwakuuwombola ikaŵe mmwe, ni uneji jwaaŵili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Nombewo ŵatite, “Tinauwombole une.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Pelepo che Boasi ŵatite, “Yambone, nambo lyuŵa lichimmombole ngunda wo mmakono mwa che Naomi chimwajigale ni che Lusi jwakuwililwa ni ŵakwakwe, melepe kuti ngunda wo usigalile mmakono mwa achalongo ŵa jwawile jo.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Nlongo njakwe jwaŵaliji jwakuŵandichila nnope jula ŵajanjile, “Iŵaga ili yeleyo uneji ngangombola kuuwombola ngunda wo kuti uŵe wangu, ligongo pelepo ikulosya kuti pachimwe ngunda wo ngasiuŵa wa ŵanache ŵangu. Mmbaya nampe mmwe chigolochelo changu cha kuuwombola ngunda wo, pakuŵa uneji ngangukombola.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Pamoŵa go mu Isilaeli iŵaga mundu ŵasachile kuwombola pane kusumanya indu, mila jao jaliji mundu akuula chilatu chakwe ni kwapa ŵane kulosya chimanyisyo. Kwa chimanyisyo cho Ŵaisilaeli ŵalosisye kuti indu iŵichikwe yambone.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Nipele mundu juŵasachilwe kuuwombola ngunda wo ŵansalile che Boasi “Nsuume mmwe,” nipele ŵausile chilatu chakwe ni kwapa. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Nombe che Boasi ŵaasalile achachekulu ŵala ni ŵandu wose, “Lelo jino ŵanyamwe nli ŵaumboni ŵangu. Mwiweni kuti suumile kuumila ku che Naomi yanayose iyaliji i che Elimeleki ni yanayose iyaliji i che Kilioni ni yanayose iyaliji i che Mahaloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Kupunda yeleyo, ngunjigala che Lusi mundu jwa ku Moabu jwawililwe ni ŵankwakwe che Mahaloni aŵe ŵankwangu, malangano ga chigatende ipanje ya maleemu ni ntundu wakwe isigalile kwa ŵandu ŵakwe pamusi wu. Ŵanyamwe nli ŵa umboni.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Ni ŵandu wose ŵaŵaliji pamalo pakutendela nkungulu kwele kwauli nnango wakwinjilila mmusi ni aŵala achachekulu ŵala ŵatite, “Elo, uweji tuli ŵa umboni. Ambuje Akunnungu antende aju jwankongwe jwakwika kukwenu ju, aŵe nti che Laeli ni che Lea, aŵala achakongwe ŵanaŵaŵili ŵaŵaŵeleche ŵanache achajinji ni kuŵa chilambo cha Isilaeli. Nomwe indu yenu injendele yambone mu achalongo wa Efulati ni mmeje ni lumbili mu Beselehemu. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Kwa litala lya ŵanache ŵachampe Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵachammelechele jwankongwe ju, ŵandu ŵa munyuumba jenu wose alandane ni ŵandu ŵa munyuumba jakwe che Pelesi, ŵati che tamali ŵaŵelechele che Yuda ŵankwakwe.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi wa che Boasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Kwapele che Boasi ŵanjigele che Lusi ni kuŵa ŵankwakwe. Che Boasi ŵawonegene ni che Lusi ni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampele upile che Lusi ni ŵakwete chitumbo. Ni che Lusi ŵaligopwele mwanache jwannume. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Ni achakongwe ŵa musi wo ŵansalile che Naomi, “Alapikwe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵangananleka lelo jino pangali nlongo jwakuŵandichila jwakunlela, liina lya jweleju liŵe lyekulu pa Isilaeli jose. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Mwanache jo chantende mkole machili sooni mu utame wenu ni channele mu uchekulu wenu. Pakuŵa akwegwenu jwakunnonyela ni jwali jwambone nnope kupunda ŵanache nsano ni ŵaŵili ŵachilume ni jwambeleche.” <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Nipele che Naomi ŵanjigele mwanache jo, ŵampakete ni ŵaliji jwakunnela.<verse eid="RUT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Achakongwe ŵapachiŵandi pao ŵatite, “Che Naomi apatile wisukulu wa chilume.” Ŵampele mwanache jo liina lyakwe Obedi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:17">Nipele che Obedi ŵammeleche che Yese jwaali atati ŵa che Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Welewu uli uŵelesi u che Pelesi, che Pelesi ŵammeleche che Hesiloni, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />ni che Hesiloni ŵammeleche che Lami ni che Lami ŵammeleche che Aminadabu, <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />ni che Aminadabu ŵammeleche che Nashoni ni che Nashoni ŵammeleche che Salumoni, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />ni che Salumoni ŵammeleche che Boasi ni che Boasi ŵammeleche che Obedi, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />ni che Obedi ŵammeleche che Yese ni che Yese ŵammeleche che Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>